# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# AI-DOS block for the .gitignore of a project with an embedded AI-DOS
# (integration/state-and-artifacts.md). Append between the markers; the rest
# of the project's .gitignore stays project-owned.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# ai-dos:begin
# Runtime data without long-term value: logs, caches, temporary context
# packages, update staging, large intermediate artifacts.
.ai-dos/state/runtime/
*.audit.log

# Secrets and credentials (keep if the project does not already ignore them)
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.env
.envrc
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.jks
*.keystore
*.kdbx
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*
id_ecdsa*
*.ppk
credentials
credentials.*
*credentials*.json
secrets.*
*.secret
*.secrets
.npmrc
.pypirc
.netrc
service-account*.json
*.tfvars
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
# ai-dos:end
